{"thread":{"threadID":4523,"boardID":97,"topic":"GTA5, kannst du hier gewinnen :)","time":1497016120,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","lastPostTime":1497388330,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":38,"views":1099,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":66954,"threadID":4523,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"GTA5, kannst du hier gewinnen :)","time":1497016120,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1497025085,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1497029081,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br>Hallo liebe Dream-Community,<br>anlässlich zum 09.06, verlosen wir heute eine Kopie des Spiels Grand Theft Auto V.<br>Ich kann heute leider kein Bild auf &quot;gutem Niveau&quot; machen, da ich nicht an meinem Computer bin, deshalb hier:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br></p></div><p><br>Ihr habt Zeit bis zum 10.06 (Samstag) um 22:00.<br>Der Gewinner wird anschließend zufällig ermittelt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66955,"threadID":4523,"userID":2349,"username":"chaotic","subject":"","time":1497016319,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wünsche jedem viel Glück beim giveaway, ich brauchs nicht <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😘</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66957,"threadID":4523,"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","subject":"","time":1497016432,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich will es haben weil ich dann GTA spielen kann lel</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":66958,"threadID":4523,"userID":2418,"username":"Neo","subject":"","time":1497016983,"lastEd